  "body": "Section 4.5 says that the default \"effective script origin\" of a Document is an alias of its origin, linking \"alias\" to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#concept-origin-alias. That link doesn't appear to work; it just redirects to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#browsers, and the term \"alias\" is nowhere on the page.\n",
